 good at grasping customers' needs and able to respond timely and accurately.\n4- “Drive” to support the achievement of financial sales goals.\n5- Good at team work, strong self-motivated and self-learner, good management in the work process and target.","ClassificationOne":"销售类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"10年及以上","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-29T11:40:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"237637c6-921e-4ac7-86b5-67ca37b0133c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151094065,"PostDateInt":1761705392000,"PostDate":"2025-10-29T10:36:32","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"伺服技术经理(J10402)","OrgId":891378,"Org":"嵌入式开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责伺服组日常技术管理工作，负责伺服电机驱动器、协作关节的研发\n2. 负责电机控制系统内策略及算法的设计\n3. 负责机器人关节的抑振算法设计与开发\n4. 推导建立动力学模型,建立位置、速度及电流或者力矩反馈在内的闭环控制系统\n5. 完成设计开发过程中技术文件的编写和归档\n6. 协助控制器项目组其他工作","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历,电子、自动化、电气工程及其自动化专业\n2. 5年无刷电机(BLDC、PMSM)控制器开发经验,精通电机PID控制,FOC控制,震动抑制,电机参数观测等经典控制法;\n3. 熟悉STM32、GD32等类型MCU硬件，以及电路设计；SPI、CANOPEN、ETHERCAT等通讯接口;\n4. 有扎实的编程能力,良好的编程风格和习惯,精通C语言。\n5. 有良好的团队协作能力,踏实,勤奋,有极强的学习新事物的能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-29T10:36:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"26e7a511-5cb3-4880-a1e6-ca850e2591ef","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151094062,"PostDateInt":1761705341000,"PostDate":"2025-10-29T10:35:41","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"控制器软件技术经理/专家(J10403)","OrgId":891378,"Org":"嵌入式开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"控制器软件技术专家\n岗位职责：\n1、 负责协作机器人控制器软件的技术路线的规划和定义\n2、负责协作机器人控制器软件的架构设计、优化\n3、负责技术上指导协作机器人控制器软件产品开发的全流程，并对团队在设计和验证层面进行评审，并牵头攻坚各类技术难题。","Require":"任职资格：\n1、硕士以上学历，自动化、机械、电气、电子等相关专业，5年以上工业机器人开发经验或5年以上协作机器人产品和项目经验。\n2、 非常熟悉协作机器人的行业，市场，需求，趋势和竞争态势，充分理解各品牌的技术特点。\n3、 精通协作机器人控制器软件技术全栈，包括\n- 精通C/C++以及Linux系统IPC、系统调用等\n- 工业总线通讯：譬如EtherCAT、ProfiNET、EthernetIP、DeviceNet等\n- 机器人自定义编程语言开发（Lua/Python等脚本语言二次开发）\n- 机器人全部软件功能、安全功能以及应用生态\n4、成功领导过至少1~2款机器人控制器产品从立项到量产阶段，并在市场上有成功的批量应用。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-29T10:35:41","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"2ef29cc5-140c-4f80-8e52-10c9e255d9bf","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093444,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件工程师(J10011)","OrgId":891377,"Org":"硬件开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"工作职责：\n1.进行硬件需求确认，需求分析；\n2.完成硬件系统框图，板卡数量、尺寸定义，互联接口定义；\n3.评估项目硬件开发周期；\n4.根据产品需求规格书，输出硬件技术规格书；\n5.根据硬件技术规格书，细化单板硬件方案，关键器件/电路选型评估；\n6.完成单板原理图/PCB详细设计，生成生产文档；\n7.完成单板功能验证，信号完整性测试；\n8.压力测试、老化测试、安规/EMC产品可靠性测试；\n9.与技术支持，软件，结构，采购等相关部门同事沟通，协调硬件支撑工作。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历\n2.5年及以上嵌入式硬件、控制器或伺服硬件开发经验；\n3.具备主导产品硬件开发工作经验.","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d8465f0e-5d4f-439f-a754-a54a1ac3abac","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093443,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"测试经理(J10014)","OrgId":891380,"Org":"测试部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"30K-50K 元/月","Duty":"职责描述：\n1、负责产品测试团队管理工作，设计测试流程，制定产品测试规范、搭建测试系统，带领测试团队，完成公司项目、产品的所有相关测试工作；\n2、全面负责公司所有产品的测试工作，为整体的测试质量负责，包括软硬件功能测试、性能测试、集成测试、测试环境的设计与搭建等;\n3、参与产品需求的分析（用户场景理解、可测试性需求开发）、需求评审等；\n4、主导产品测试需求开发，并结合产品需求和设计文档，主导制定测试计划，设计测试方案、开发测试用例等；\n5、负责公司工作分配，执行具体测试任务并确认测试结果、缺陷跟踪，完成测试报告以及测试结果分析；\n6、在测试各环节与开发、产品等部门沟通保证测试输入和输出的正确性和完备性；\n7、完成产品缺陷验证和确认，对于难以重现的缺陷，需要完成可能性原因分析与验证；\n8、与运营团队保持沟通，结合数据分析产品，并对产品进行修改、升级，快速迭代，产品规划完成后，推进设计、开发团队完成产品的设计、开发工作，将产品发布运营；\n9、引入合适的自动化测试工具，建立标准化测试平台、搭建标准化测试环境，提升测试效率；\n10、完成测试团队的管理考核及业务培训工作。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、5年以上产品软硬件测试工作经验，电气工程、电力电子、机电一体化、自动化等相关专业或相关技能，有机器人、自动化或智能硬件等相关从业经历；\n2、熟悉测试方法论、测试体系、测试原理、测试流程、测试文档标准、软件工程等； \n3、熟悉各种测试工具，具备基本的脚本语言编程能力，如Python/Ruby/Shell等；\n4、熟悉产品开发中常 用的bug管理理系统、 自动化测试 工具、性能测试工具；如Jira、QTP、LoadRunner等相关 工具；\n5、掌握从黑盒/白盒不同角度分别设计和开发测试方案对整个系统/ 子系统/单独模块进行测试的方法；\n6、对可靠性测试、失效分析FA、缺陷管理、测试用例管理有一定掌握；\n7、具备较强的的问题分析和定位的能力以及缜密的逻辑思维；\n8、对系统结构、硬件电路基础、软件运行原理、测试框架、自动化测试、性能测试等有相关经验，具备独立设计、搭建自动化测试框架，编写自动化测试脚本能力；\n9、熟悉研发管理流程、研发测试体系、IPD等类似产品开发流程；\n10、有较丰富工业机器人、自动化相关经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,